---
/** Privacy and cookies: what this site stores (nothing) and which requests leave the browser (one). */
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
import PixelText from "../components/PixelText.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy and cookies: Topi" description="This site sets no cookies and runs no analytics. What it does request, and why.">
  <PageHeader />
  <main id="main" class="paper page">
    <article class="wrap prose">
      <PixelText as="h1" text="Privacy and c{o}okies." />
      <p class="lead">A site about payments that leave no trace should leave none on you. It doesn't.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        None. The site sets no cookies and keeps nothing in your browser's local or session storage, so there is nothing to
        consent to and no banner to dismiss.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics and trackers</h2>
      <p>
        None. There are no analytics scripts, advertising tags, social widgets or third-party embeds. Fonts and images are
        served from this site.
      </p>

      <h2>The one request that leaves this site</h2>
      <p>
        To show the latest block, your browser asks the chain 8141 testnet's public RPC endpoint,
        <code>rpc1.privacy.ethrex.xyz</code>, for the block number and the pool's balance and events. That operator sees
        your IP address and browser, as any web server does. Nothing about you is sent with the request.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The hosting provider keeps standard request logs (IP address, user agent, time, path) to run and protect the
        service, under its own privacy policy. This project does not receive or keep them.
      </p>

      <h2>Security headers</h2>
      <p>
        Every page is served with a strict content security policy (scripts from this site only, no framing), HTTPS only,
        and a referrer policy that sends no paths to other sites.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Report a security issue privately through <a href="https://github.com/Naveen-6087/topi/security/advisories/new">GitHub
        security advisories</a>; see the <a href="https://github.com/Naveen-6087/topi/blob/main/SECURITY.md">security policy</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 46rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .prose :global(h1) {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }
  p {
    color: var(--fg-soft);
  }
  code {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    background: var(--paper-2);
  }
</style>
